-- AIA Khoe Tron Ven V012022 — Part I (I. QUYỀN LỢI BẢO HIỂM), the benefits, Articles 1-10.
-- Quotations (`src:N`) are generated from line N of ../../source/raw/aia-khoe-tron-ven.txt.
--
-- WHAT THIS MODULE DOES. For each benefit: the conditions the Article itself states, and the
-- amount it states. Whether the contract is in force, whether an exclusion (Article 23) or a
-- termination (Article 24) bars the claim, whether the diagnosis meets its Annex, and whether
-- the claim was made in time (Article 25) are other provisions; ktv-assessment.l4 puts them
-- together for a claim.
--
-- THE ADVANCE STRUCTURE. The early-stage benefits are "Nhận trước" (received in advance): the
-- major cancer, severe-stage critical illness, TPD and death benefits each pay the larger of the
-- sum insured and the basic account value, plus the top-up account value, less the cancer and
-- critical-illness benefits already paid and the debts (src 307-327, set out in Article 6).
-- That formula is encoded once, `the main benefit formula`, and refuses where it goes below
-- zero, which the document does not provide for (finding X3).

§ `Part I — benefits`

