-- src:48 | I. QUYỀN LỢI BẢO HIỂM

§§ `Shared: the advance payment and the main benefit formula`

-- Which payments count as "Quyền lợi bảo hiểm Bệnh ung thư và Bệnh hiểm nghèo đã được chi trả":
-- every cancer and every critical-illness benefit. Not the ICU benefit or the premium-support
-- benefit, which Articles 3(b)(ii) and 4(c) say are not deducted; not the cancer-screening
-- support, which is credited to the top-up account and so already sits in the formula's
-- "Giá trị tài khoản đóng thêm" (fork F15).
@ref Articles 1(a)(iii), 2(a)(ii), 6(a)
GIVEN `the benefit` IS A Benefit
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`a cancer or critical-illness benefit:` `the benefit` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the benefit`
    WHEN `the cancer benefit for` k                      THEN TRUE
    WHEN `the early-stage critical illness benefit for` c THEN TRUE
    WHEN `the severe-stage critical illness benefit for` c THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

GIVEN `the payments` IS A LIST OF `Payment already made`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the cancer and critical-illness benefits already paid in` `the payments` MEANS
    sum (map (GIVEN p YIELD p's `the amount`)
             (filter (GIVEN p YIELD `a cancer or critical-illness benefit:` (p's `the benefit`)) `the payments`))

GIVEN `the benefit`  IS A Benefit
      `the payments` IS A LIST OF `Payment already made`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`a payment of` `the benefit` `is among` `the payments` MEANS
    any (GIVEN p YIELD p's `the benefit` EQUALS `the benefit`) `the payments`

-- "Nhận trước 30% Số tiền bảo hiểm, nhưng không vượt quá 500 triệu đồng" (Articles 1(a)(i),
-- 1(a)(ii), 2(a)(i)).
@ref Articles 1(a)(i)-(ii), 2(a)(i) (src 71-80, 136-138)
GIVEN `the account` IS AN `Account snapshot`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the advance of 30% of the sum insured, at most 500 million dong, on` `the account` MEANS
    min (30% TIMES `the account`'s `sum insured`) (500 TIMES 1000000)

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the main benefit formula gives less than nothing, and the document does not say what is paid` MEANS
    REFUSE "the main benefit formula gives less than nothing, and the document does not say what is paid"

@ref Articles 1(a)(iii), 2(a)(ii), 6(a) (src 85-108, 140-152, 307-327)
GIVEN `the account`  IS AN `Account snapshot`
      `the payments` IS A LIST OF `Payment already made`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the main benefit formula on` `the account` `after` `the payments` MEANS
    IF   `the result` LESS THAN 0
    THEN `the main benefit formula gives less than nothing, and the document does not say what is paid`
    ELSE `the result`
    WHERE
        `the result` MEANS
                 max (`the account`'s `sum insured`) (`the account`'s `basic account value`)
            PLUS `the account`'s `top-up account value`
            MINUS `the cancer and critical-illness benefits already paid in` `the payments`
            MINUS `the account`'s `debts`

-- Articles 1(c), 2(d), 6(b): premiums received after the event are refunded without interest.
@ref Articles 1(c), 2(d), 6(b) (src 120-125, 172-184, 328-331)
GIVEN `the premiums received after the event` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the refund of premiums received after the event, without interest:` `the premiums received after the event` MEANS
    `the premiums received after the event`

