@ref Article 1(a) (src 54-116)
GIVEN `the kind`     IS A `Kind of cancer`
      `the account`  IS AN `Account snapshot`
      `the payments` IS A LIST OF `Payment already made`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 1(a) — the cancer benefit for` `the kind` `, on` `the account` `after` `the payments` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the kind`
    WHEN `early-stage cancer`    THEN `the advance of 30% of the sum insured, at most 500 million dong, on` `the account`
    WHEN `carcinoma in situ`     THEN `the advance of 30% of the sum insured, at most 500 million dong, on` `the account`
    WHEN `major cancer`          THEN `the main benefit formula on` `the account` `after` `the payments`
    WHEN `extended major cancer` THEN 100% TIMES `the account`'s `sum insured`

