@ref Article 1(b) (src 118-119)
GIVEN `the kind`     IS A `Kind of cancer`
      `the payments` IS A LIST OF `Payment already made`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 1(b) — the cancer benefit for` `the kind` `has not yet been paid in` `the payments` MEANS
    NOT `a payment of` (`the cancer benefit for` `the kind`) `is among` `the payments`

