-- Article 2(c) permits several different early-stage illnesses "trong giới hạn chi trả tương
-- ứng" (within the corresponding payment limit). The document names no aggregate limit of the
-- early-stage benefits other than the termination at 100% of the sum insured in Article
-- 24(a)(iii); each early-stage payment is taken at its full amount, so the payment that crosses
-- 100% is paid in full (fork F16, finding X2). Article 2(c) is encoded by the absence of any
-- other bar: `Article 2(b)` bars only the same condition twice.

