-- (src 241-252: 9 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Article 4 (src 234-252)
GIVEN `the account` IS AN `Account snapshot`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 4(a) — the premium-support benefit on` `the account` MEANS
    200% TIMES `the account`'s `annualised basic premium`

-- (a) "lần đầu được chẩn đoán" (first diagnosed) one of the early-stage cancers or illnesses;
-- (c) once in the contract term, paid with whichever early-stage benefit is paid first.
@ref Article 4(a), (c) (src 234-252)
GIVEN `the benefit claimed` IS A Benefit
      `the payments`        IS A LIST OF `Payment already made`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 4 — the premium-support benefit goes with` `the benefit claimed` `after` `the payments` MEANS
        (CONSIDER `the benefit claimed`
         WHEN `the cancer benefit for` k
             THEN k EQUALS `early-stage cancer` OR k EQUALS `carcinoma in situ`
         WHEN `the early-stage critical illness benefit for` c THEN TRUE
         OTHERWISE FALSE)
    AND NOT `a payment of` `the premium-support benefit` `is among` `the payments`

