-- "Tại ngày cuối cùng của mỗi chu kỳ 5 Năm hợp đồng": the last day of contract years 5, 10, 15
-- and so on, to the end of the term. The conditions run "trong Thời hạn hợp đồng" (during the
-- contract term): read as the term up to that day (fork F18).
@ref Article 5(a) (src 258-280)
GIVEN `the contract year` IS A NUMBER
      `the record`        IS A `Premium record`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 5(a) — the cancer-screening support is due at the end of contract year` `the contract year` `on` `the record` MEANS
        `the contract year` AT LEAST 5
    AND `the contract year` MODULO 5 EQUALS 0
    AND "(i)"   ... `the record`'s `lowest sum insured during the term so far` AT LEAST (1000 TIMES 1000000)
    AND "(ii)"  ... NOT `the record`'s `the contract has ever lapsed`
    AND "(iii)" ... `the record`'s `annual basic premium paid in full before each policy anniversary so far`

@ref Article 5(a) (src 258-260)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 5(a) — the cancer-screening support` MEANS 5 TIMES 1000000

-- Article 5(b): credited to the top-up account automatically; Article 22(b)(ii) adds it.

